OL,3,GNEWSASearch finds families of soldiers
OL,4,Aon French memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe relatives of six British soldiers
OL,7,Fcommemorated in a Normandy village have
OL,8,Fall been traced after a two-year
OL,9,Fsearch, including the family of a
OL,10,FLeicestershire serviceman.
OL,12,FAn appeal helped find the family of
OL,13,FL/Sgt George Richard Williams, of the
OL,14,F1st Battalion Leicestershire Regiment,
OL,15,Fwho died at 27 while fighting to
OL,16,Fliberate the village of Le Fournet from
OL,17,FGerman occupation in 1944.
OL,19,FHis granddaughter, Michelle Ward, said
OL,20,Fthe family knew little about him other
OL,21,Fthan that he died in World War Two.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
